                                    <p>Stele of marble, decreasing in size towards top, found before 1900, presumably in Ayazviran, transported to Evangelike Schole in Smyrna. Now apparently lost. Height 1 m., width at top 31 cm., at bottom 45 cm. Moulding at top.</p>
                                    <material ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/48.html">marble</material>
                                    <objectType ref="https://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/250.html">stele</objectType>
