                            </supportDesc>
                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout>
                                    <p>Long confession stele recording divine punishment of Tatia (accused of poisoning her son-in-law Iokoundos) and her son Sokrates, and subsequent propitiation by her grandchildren.</p>
                                    <rs ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1">incisa a scalpello</rs>
